'''Spratt''' is a [[Pixies|pixie]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] [[Merchants|merchant]] that can be found in [[Snowhill]]. She sells exclusively [[Medic]] [[Jobs|Job]] [[Items|items]].

==Sells==
*[[Emergency Medic Backpack]]
*[[Emergency Medic Fatigues]]
*[[Emergency Medic Cap]]
*[[Emergency Medic Gloves]]
*[[Emergency Medic Boots]]
*[[Emergency Medic Shirt]]
*[[Medic's Flair Shard of Miracles]]
*[[Medic's Power Shard of Vitality III]]
*[[Medic's Necklace of Vitality III]]
*[[Medic's Ring of Regeneration III]]
*[[Medic's Bonesaw of Immunization]]
*[[Medic's Bonesaw of Vitals]]
*[[Medic's Bonesaw of Triage]]

==Trivia==
*Spratt was introduced in-game on August 27, 2013.
